  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leveraging Global Fund&#x2019;s RSSH investments in DRC to contribute to the attainment of universal health coverage  and other health-related targets of the Sustainable Development Goals - Congo (Democratic Republic) (01-Jan-2024-31-Dec-2026)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Congo (Democratic Republic), RSSH, Ministry of Public Health, Hygiene and Social Security (MOH DRC)This program has the following goals: Contribuer au bien-&#xea;tre de la population congolaise d&#x2019;ici 2026 dans le cadre de la couverture sanitaire universelle et des autres cibles des objectifs de d&#xe9;veloppement durable (ODD) / Contribute to the well-being of the Congolese population by 2026 as part of universal health coverage and other targets of the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs).. The objectives of this program are: Axe strat&#xe9;gique 1 : Am&#xe9;lioration des prestations des services de sant&#xe9; et continuit&#xe9; des soins / Strategic focus 1: Improving health service delivery and continuity of care..  Axe strat&#xe9;gique 2 : Appui aux piliers du syst&#xe8;me de sant&#xe9; pour am&#xe9;liorer la disponibilit&#xe9; et l&#x2019;accessibilit&#xe9; de soins de qualit&#xe9; / Strategic focus 2: Support for the pillars of the health system to improve the availability and accessibility of quality care..  Axe strat&#xe9;gique 3 : Appui &#xe0; la gouvernance, au leadership et au pilotage du syst&#xe8;me de sant&#xe9; / Strategic focus 3: Support for governance, leadership and management of the health system.</narrative>
  </description>
